    "title": "Lawyer for Ville Platte mayor speaks out; claims charges will be dropped in public corruption case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 days ago The lawyer for one of five local officials arrested on public corruption charges is speaking out and proclaiming his client's innocence. The lawyer for Ville Platte Mayor Ryan Williams said the accusations are false. The defense lawyer added the mayor is cooperating with authorities. He noted that he believes prosecutors are likely to drop the charges against his client once their investigation is completed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
